 font-weight: bolder;\">KEY FEATURES:</strong></h3><ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; list-style-type: disc; line-height: 1.7em; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; padding: 0px 0px var(--spacing--block) var(--spacing--block);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><br><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; list-style-type: circle; line-height: 1.7em; padding: 0px 0px 0px var(--spacing--block);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Durable Exterior:</strong> Crafted with heavy-duty canvas fabric to withstand the demands of travel.</li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><br><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; list-style-type: circle; line-height: 1.7em; padding: 0px 0px 0px var(--spacing--block);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Spacious Interior:</strong> Ample room with securing straps to neatly store costumes, feather wings, gowns, and other delicate garments.</li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><br><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; list-style-type: circle; line-height: 1.7em; padding: 0px 0px 0px var(--spacing--block);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Multiple Carry Options:</strong> Comfort handles and adjustable, removable shoulder straps make it easy to carry however you prefer.</li></ul></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><br><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; list-style-type: circle; line-height: 1.7em; padding: 0px 0px 0px var(--spacing--block);\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: list-item;\"><str